WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.577 line:92%
OH

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:11.077 line:92%
I,

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:11.578 line:92%
I,

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:21.488 line:85%
I THINK WE JUST MADE SOME
HISTORY.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:22.422 line:92%
SO,

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.257 line:92%
SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:24.924 line:92%
YOU

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.731 line:85%
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION WHAT
IS POSSIBLE.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.101 line:85%
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION THAT
IN THIS

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:37.971 line:92%
ERA OF PARTISAN DIVIDES,

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:40.240 line:92%
OF VITRIOL AND NAME-CALLING.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:45.879 line:83%
IN A POLITICS DOMINATED BY
BILLIONAIRES AND SPECIAL
INTEREST GROUPS AND

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:52.719 line:85%
INSIDERS IN WASHINGTON DC THAT
WE WILL NOT BOW DOWN.

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:01.161 line:85%
THAT WE WILL NOT BACK DOWN AND
WE WILL CHART OUR OWN COURSE.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.768 line:83%
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION THAT
WE CAN COME TOGETHER TO DEFEND
SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:21.081 line:83%
AND TODAY YOU HAVE ELECTED A
SENATOR THAT WILL ALWAYS PUT
SOUTH CAROLINA FIRST.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:22.782 line:92%
NOT ONLY THAT,

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:24.350 line:92%
BUT YOU HAVE ELECTED

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:26.853 line:92%
THE FIRST PEDIATRICIAN.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:34.761 line:92%
UNITED STATES SENATE

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.765 line:92%
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:53.379 line:83%
THE FIRST WOMAN THAT SOUTH
CAROLINA HAS EVER SENT TO THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:56.116 line:92%
SO FROM THE BOTTOM OF MY HEART,

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:57.584 line:92%
THANK YOU.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:00.120 line:92%
I WANNA START BY THANKING

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:01.521 line:92%
DARLENE GRAHAM

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:03.623 line:92%
FOR HER PUBLIC SERVICE

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:06.092 line:92%
AND HER LOVE FOR SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:08.728 line:85%
AND I WISH HER AND HER FAMILY
WELL.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:09.829 line:92%
AND I,

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.464 line:92%
AND I JUST,

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:21.975 line:83%
AND I JUST SPOKE WITH HER AND
SHE CONGRATULATED ME ON OUR
VICTORY TONIGHT.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:24.144 line:92%
AND TO THE HEARTBEAT,

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:26.379 line:92%
THE HEARTBEAT OF OUR CAMPAIGN,

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:30.049 line:92%
OUR VOLUNTEERS.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.187 line:85%
WHO WORKED THEIR TAILS OFF AND
NEVER STOPPED BELIEVING,

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:34.787 line:92%
THANK YOU,

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:35.288 line:92%
THANK YOU,

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:36.723 line:92%
THANK YOU.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:40.093 line:85%
AND TO OUR STATE PARTY
CHAIRWOMAN,

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:43.997 line:92%
CRYSTAL SPAIN.

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.398 line:92%
THE FIRST

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:52.705 line:85%
BLACK WOMAN TO LEAD OUR STATE'S
PARTY.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:55.074 line:92%
WHO INVESTED IN THIS RACE,

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:56.142 line:92%
WHO BELIEVED IN US,

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:57.243 line:92%
WHO BELIEVED IN ME,

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.878 line:92%
AND WORKED TIRELESSLY,

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:04.217 line:83%
TIRELESSLY TO BUILD A STRONGER
SOUTH CAROLINA ACROSS ALL 46
COUNTIES.

00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:04.851 line:92%
THANK YOU,

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:08.288 line:92%
CRYSTAL.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.191 line:85%
AND TO MY DEAR FRIEND JAMIE
HARRISON,

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:12.992 line:85%
WE WOULD NOT BE HERE WITHOUT
YOU.

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:16.696 line:92%
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:22.569 line:83%
TO ALL OF OUR INCREDIBLE STAFF
WHO POURED THEIR HEARTS AND
SOULS INTO THIS RACE,

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:24.938 line:92%
THANK YOU.

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:29.375 line:85%
TO THE THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE WHO
WELCOMED US INTO THEIR HOMES,

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:30.076 line:92%
THEIR CHURCHES,

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:30.843 line:92%
THEIR BUSINESSES,

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:32.612 line:92%
AND ONTO THEIR FRONT PORCHES,

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:36.182 line:92%
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:38.084 line:92%
AND TO THE REPUBLICANS,

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:39.352 line:92%
INDEPENDENTS,

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:41.955 line:85%
AND DEMOCRATS WHO TOOK A CHANCE
ON A PEDIATRICIAN

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.859 line:92%
AND A MOM OF THREE.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:51.397 line:85%
BECAUSE YOU BELIEVE THAT SOUTH
CAROLINA SHOULD COME FIRST,

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:54.400 line:92%
THANK YOU.

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:55.702 line:92%
SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.237 line:85%
MY NAME MAY HAVE BEEN ON THE
BALLOT,

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.038 line:85%
BUT THIS VICTORY DOESN'T BELONG
TO ME.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:03.443 line:92%
IT BELONGS TO ALL OF YOU.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:04.911 line:92%
BECAUSE TONIGHT,

00:04:06.679 --> 00:04:07.814 line:85%
WE HERE IN SOUTH CAROLINA SENT A
CLEAR MESSAGE

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.117 line:85%
THAT THIS SENATE SEAT DOES NOT
BELONG TO ONE FAMILY,

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:12.318 line:92%
ONE PARTY,

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:20.660 line:92%
OR TO WASHINGTON DC.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:24.297 line:85%
IT BELONGS TO YOU AND IT ALWAYS
WILL.

00:04:26.866 --> 00:04:27.767 line:85%
WE EMBARKED ON THIS JOURNEY OVER
18 MONTHS AGO,

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:30.236 line:85%
AND WHILE IT WAS LONG AND
EXHAUSTING,

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:34.741 line:83%
AND THERE WERE PLENTY OF DAYS
WHEN I WAS RUNNING ON NOTHING
BUT PROTEIN BARS,

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:35.308 line:92%
COFFEE,

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:37.610 line:85%
AND GIANT DIET COKES FROM GAS
STATIONS.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:40.580 line:85%
IT TRULY HAS BEEN THE JOURNEY OF
A LIFETIME.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:44.250 line:85%
WE TOOK THIS CAMPAIGN TO EVERY
SINGLE ONE OF OUR 46 COUNTIES,

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:46.819 line:85%
FROM SMALL TOWNS AND MAIN
STREETS TO FARMS

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:48.087 line:92%
AND OUR RURAL COMMUNITIES,

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:51.057 line:85%
FROM THE BLUE RIDGE MOUNTAINS IN
THE UPSTATE TO THE SWAMPS,

00:04:52.425 --> 00:04:53.126 line:85%
THE LITERAL SWAMPS IN THE
MIDLANDS,

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:58.598 line:85%
TO THE BEACHES HERE IN THE LOW
COUNTRY.

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:03.803 line:85%
I SAT ON THE BACK OF A PICKUP
TRUCK WITH AN 8TH GENERATION

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:37.170 line:85%
FARMER IN BARNWELL WHO TOLD ME
THAT IT NOW COST HER $1900.

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:38.004 line:92%
Y'ALL,

00:05:39.772 --> 00:05:40.573 line:85%
I THOUGHT MY FARMER FRIEND WAS
HERE.

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:45.545 line:85%
SHE TOLD ME IT COST $1900 TO
FILL UP HER TRACTOR WITH DIESEL

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.681 line:85%
AND THAT TANK OF GAS WILL ONLY
LAST HER FOR 3 DAYS.

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:51.884 line:85%
AND THAT FARM THAT'S BEEN IN HER
SOUTH CAROLINA FAMILY FOR EIGHT

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:55.688 line:83%
GENERATIONS MIGHT NOT LAST
ANOTHER YEAR OR TWO IF THINGS
DON'T CHANGE.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.291 line:85%
I STOOD SHOULDER TO SHOULDER
WITH VETERANS IN RIDGELAND,

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:01.027 line:85%
TEARS IN THEIR EYES AS THEY TOLD
ME THAT THEY'VE LOST

00:06:02.328 --> 00:06:02.628 line:92%
FRIENDS TO SUICIDE,

00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:03.830 line:92%
THAT THEIR FIGHT

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:05.565 line:85%
FOR THEIR BENEFITS THAT THEY'VE
EARNED,

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:11.971 line:83%
AND THEIR FEAR OF ANOTHER
GENERATION BEING SENT OFF TO A
RECKLESS WAR.

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:15.808 line:85%
I'VE SPOKEN TO SENIORS WHO'VE
WORKED THEIR ENTIRE LIVES,

00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:16.576 line:92%
RAISED THEIR FAMILY,

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.111 line:92%
AND DID EVERYTHING

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:18.911 line:92%
RIGHT,

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:22.648 line:83%
ONLY TO FIND THEMSELVES
STRUGGLING TO GET BY ON THEIR
SOCIAL SECURITY CHECKS.

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:26.519 line:83%
I'VE SEEN NEIGHBORS LOOKING OUT
FOR EACH OTHER REGARDLESS OF
POLITICAL PARTY,

00:06:28.855 --> 00:06:29.822 line:85%
FAMILIES COMING TOGETHER TO HELP
EACH OTHER THROUGH HARD TIMES,

00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:32.925 line:85%
AND CHURCH CONGREGATIONS OPENING
THEIR HEARTS AND DOORS

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:35.461 line:85%
TO ANYONE WHO NEEDS A HELPING
HAND.

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:38.064 line:85%
THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA THAT
I KNOW.

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:46.105 line:85%
THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA THAT
I AM PROUD TO CALL HOME.

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:49.409 line:85%
AND THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA
THAT I WILL FIGHT

00:06:52.812 --> 00:06:56.983 line:85%
FOR EVERY SINGLE DAY IN THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:01.487 line:85%
AND TO THE SOUTH CAROLINIANS WHO
DID NOT VOTE FOR ME,

00:07:03.389 --> 00:07:04.357 line:85%
I KNOW WE MAY NOT AGREE ON
EVERYTHING,

00:07:06.192 --> 00:07:06.859 line:85%
AND I MAY NOT HAVE EARNED YOUR
VOTE TODAY,

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:08.461 line:92%
BUT I WANT YOU TO KNOW THIS,

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.733 line:92%
I WILL BE YOUR SENATOR TOO.

00:07:14.834 --> 00:07:15.401 line:92%
I WILL LISTEN TO YOU,

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.003 line:92%
I WILL SHOW UP FOR YOU,

00:07:21.407 --> 00:07:21.974 line:83%
AND I WILL FIGHT JUST AS HARD
FOR YOU AND YOUR CHILDREN AS I
WOULD MY OWN.

00:07:24.143 --> 00:07:26.913 line:85%
THAT'S THE KIND OF SENATOR THAT
I'LL BE.

00:07:29.882 --> 00:07:30.283 line:85%
I'LL BE AN INDEPENDENT VOICE WHO
WILL WORK WITH ANYONE,

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:31.617 line:92%
REPUBLICAN OR DEMOCRAT,

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:33.886 line:85%
TO DO WHAT'S RIGHT FOR SOUTH
CAROLINA.

00:07:36.923 --> 00:07:37.924 line:83%
I WILL BE A BRICK WALL BETWEEN
WASHINGTON DC AND SOUTH
CAROLINA,

00:07:40.359 --> 00:07:42.462 line:85%
EVEN WHEN IT MEANS STANDING UP
TO MY OWN PARTY.

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:48.701 line:85%
NOBODY IN WASHINGTON RECRUITED
ME TO RUN.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:55.842 line:85%
NOBODY HANDED ME A SEAT IN THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:07:59.011 --> 00:07:59.312 line:92%
AND NOBODY WROTE ME A SCRIPT.

00:08:00.012 --> 00:08:00.079 line:92%
I,

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:00.780 line:92%
I,

00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:03.716 line:92%
I OWE NO ONE IN WASHINGTON

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:04.650 line:92%
ANYTHING.

00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:06.752 line:92%
I OWE SOUTH CAROLINA

00:08:07.553 --> 00:08:11.624 line:92%
EVERYTHING.

00:08:13.926 --> 00:08:15.094 line:85%
AND THAT'S EXACTLY WHO I'M GONNA
ANSWER TO.

00:08:17.897 --> 00:08:18.164 line:85%
NOW I NEVER IMAGINED THAT I
WOULD END UP IN POLITICS.

00:08:18.464 --> 00:08:19.465 line:92%
SINCE I WAS 4,

00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:21.968 line:85%
I'VE ONLY EVER DREAMED OF
BECOMING A DOCTOR,

00:08:22.702 --> 00:08:23.970 line:92%
AND FOR THE PAST 20 YEARS,

00:08:25.738 --> 00:08:27.106 line:85%
I'VE DEDICATED MY LIFE TO CARING
FOR SICK AND INJURED CHILDREN.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.178 line:83%
BUT WHAT I SAW AS A PEDIATRICIAN
AND WHAT I'VE EXPERIENCED
RAISING MY OWN 3 CHILDREN

00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:35.481 line:83%
MADE ME REALIZE THAT I COULDN'T
JUST SIT ON THE SIDELINES
ANYMORE.

00:08:38.117 --> 00:08:38.784 line:85%
I WATCHED AS INSURANCE COMPANIES
STOOD BETWEEN SICK CHILDREN

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:40.219 line:92%
AND THE CARE THAT THEY NEED.

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:43.656 line:85%
I'VE SEEN HOW DECISIONS MADE IN
WASHINGTON AFFECT THE

00:08:45.725 --> 00:08:46.192 line:85%
LIVES OF THE CHILDREN AND
FAMILIES I'VE CARED FOR,

00:08:46.826 --> 00:08:48.160 line:92%
AND THAT'S WHY I DECIDED TO RUN,

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:52.765 line:83%
BECAUSE I BELIEVE WE HAVE A
RESPONSIBILITY TO LEAVE OUR
CHILDREN SOMETHING BETTER

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.002 line:92%
THAN WHAT WE INHERITED.

00:09:00.172 --> 00:09:00.840 line:83%
A SOUTH CAROLINA WHERE A FAMILY
CAN AFFORD TO FILL UP A GAS
TANK,

00:09:01.607 --> 00:09:02.475 line:92%
PUT GROCERIES ON THE TABLE,

00:09:04.176 --> 00:09:04.577 line:85%
AND GET THE CHILDCARE THEY NEED
WITHOUT

00:09:05.912 --> 00:09:06.512 line:92%
WORRYING ABOUT GOING BROKE.

00:09:08.848 --> 00:09:09.549 line:85%
WHEN DECISIONS WHERE DECISIONS
ABOUT OUR COMMUNITIES

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:11.284 line:92%
ARE MADE BY THE PEOPLE WHO LIVE

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:12.685 line:92%
IN OUR COMMUNITIES,

00:09:15.621 --> 00:09:16.956 line:83%
NOT THE BILLIONAIRES OR DATA
CENTER COMPANIES IN WASHINGTON
DC.

00:09:22.361 --> 00:09:23.296 line:83%
AND WHERE THE NEXT GENERATION
CAN AFFORD TO BUILD A LIFE AND
RAISE A FAMILY HERE.

00:09:25.264 --> 00:09:27.533 line:85%
THAT'S THE FUTURE THAT I'M
FIGHTING FOR.

00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:30.870 line:85%
AND I KNOW THAT THE WORK AHEAD
WON'T BE EASY,

00:09:34.807 --> 00:09:34.941 line:83%
BUT AFTER 18 MONTHS IN 46
COUNTIES AND EVERYTHING WE'VE
BEEN THROUGH

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:35.942 line:92%
TOGETHER,

00:09:38.311 --> 00:09:38.377 line:85%
I'VE NEVER BEEN MORE CERTAIN OF
ONE THING.

00:09:42.515 --> 00:10:02.735 line:85%
SOUTH CAROLINA'S BEST DAYS ARE
STILL AHEAD OF US.

00:10:07.106 --> 00:10:08.074 line:83%
AND I PROMISE YOU I'M GONNA GIVE
YOU EVERYTHING I HAVE TO MAKE
SURE WE GET THERE.

00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:10.142 line:85%
TO BUILD A SOUTH CAROLINA YOU
CAN AFFORD,

00:10:12.111 --> 00:10:13.179 line:85%
A SOUTH CAROLINA YOU CAN ALWAYS
BE PROUD TO CALL HOME,

00:10:15.414 --> 00:10:15.982 line:85%
AND A SOUTH CAROLINA THAT WILL
ALWAYS COME FIRST.

00:10:17.416 --> 00:10:18.084 line:85%
SO THANK YOU FOR BELIEVING IN
ME.

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:20.820 line:85%
THANK YOU FOR MAKING HISTORY
WITH ME

00:10:21.821 --> 00:10:21.921 line:92%
TONIGHT.

00:10:22.321 --> 00:10:22.688 line:92%
AND,

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:24.557 line:92%
AND MOST IMPORTANTLY,

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:27.893 line:83%
WE HAD TO MOVE THIS PART TO THE
END SO I WOULDN'T BE A
BLUBBERING IDIOT UP HERE.

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:29.161 line:92%
MOST IMPORTANTLY,

00:10:29.495 --> 00:10:29.929 line:92%
THANK YOU

00:10:30.796 --> 00:10:35.201 line:92%
TO MY FAMILY.

00:10:40.172 --> 00:10:41.841 line:85%
TO MY PARENTS WHO HAVE STOOD BY
ME EVERY STEP OF THE WAY.

00:10:42.775 --> 00:10:43.275 line:92%
AND TO MY,

00:10:44.543 --> 00:10:51.350 line:92%
TO MY 3 CHILDREN.

00:10:53.285 --> 00:10:53.786 line:92%
THANK YOU FOR EVERY HUG,

00:10:56.122 --> 00:10:56.789 line:92%
EVERY WORD OF ENCOURAGEMENT.

00:10:57.757 --> 00:10:58.424 line:92%
I LOVE YOU MORE.

00:11:00.159 --> 00:11:00.359 line:92%
I LOVE YOU MORE THAN WORDS,

00:11:00.693 --> 00:11:01.394 line:92%
HENRY,

00:11:02.862 --> 00:11:03.262 line:92%
THAN WORDS WILL EVER EXPRESS.

00:11:04.797 --> 00:11:09.769 line:92%
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU GUYS.

00:11:15.641 --> 00:11:19.545 line:83%
AND BEING YOUR MOM WILL ALWAYS
BE THE MOST IMPORTANT JOB I
HAVE.

00:11:20.212 --> 00:11:20.913 line:92%
RIGHT.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:21.681 line:92%
ALL RIGHT.

00:11:25.151 --> 00:11:25.518 line:85%
AND I HOPE THAT WHEN YOU LOOK
BACK ON THIS MOMENT,

00:11:25.718 --> 00:11:26.519 line:92%
ALL THREE OF YOU,

00:11:27.486 --> 00:11:28.220 line:85%
I HOPE THAT YOU REMEMBER
SOMETHING

00:11:31.123 --> 00:11:31.157 line:85%
THAT YOU CAN STAND UP FOR WHAT
YOU BELIEVE IN.

00:11:34.994 --> 00:11:35.428 line:85%
THAT YOU CAN SPEAK OUT WHEN
SOMETHING ISN'T RIGHT.

00:11:36.962 --> 00:11:38.164 line:85%
AND NO MATTER HOW BIG THE
CHALLENGE,

00:11:41.167 --> 00:11:45.271 line:85%
YOU SHOULD NEVER BE AFRAID TO
TRY TO MAKE THINGS BETTER.

00:11:50.443 --> 00:11:55.247 line:83%
BECAUSE YOU NEVER KNOW WHAT'S
POSSIBLE IF YOU'RE WILLING TO
TRY.

00:11:57.016 --> 00:11:57.116 line:92%
SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:11:58.851 --> 00:11:58.984 line:92%
I LOVE YOU.

00:12:00.152 --> 00:12:00.352 line:92%
THANK YOU

00:12:01.721 --> 00:12:06.721 line:92%
AND GOOD NIGHT.

